# Changes applied on top of kernel.config to slim it down to the AM64x.
#
# kernel.config is generated, not hand-edited. To apply this fragment:
#   nix build .#mixosConfigurations.fill-station.config.boot.kernel.resolvedConfig
#   cp result/config nix/overlays/by-name/crt/fill-station-linux/kernel.config
# and review result/diffconfig.txt. Options listed in required.config must
# stay =y. Lines use the usual Kconfig syntax: CONFIG_X=y or
# "# CONFIG_X is not set".
